WEBVTT

history-onset
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Funsani ngati kuona kwasintha ndiponso ngati kwafooka pang'onopang'ono kapena mwadzidzidzi.

history-symptoms
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Funsani za ululu, kufiira kwa diso, ngati vuto lili m'diso limodzi kapena onse awiri, ndi ngati ntchito za tsiku ndi tsiku zavuta.

history-gradual
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Kawirikawiri ng'ala imachititsa kuona mosadziwika bwino pang'onopang'ono popanda ululu.

history-both
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Ng'ala ingagwire maso onse awiri, koma zizindikiro zingasiyane m'diso lililonse.

history-sudden
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Kusiya kuona mwadzidzidzi kungasonyeze vuto kutsogolo kapena kumbuyo kwa diso. Munthuyo afunika kuyezedwa mwachangu.

history-pain
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Ululu kapena diso lofiira zingasonyeze vuto kutsogolo kwa diso. Tumizani wodwalayo kuti akayesedwe musaganize kuti ndi ng'ala.

acuity-distance
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Yezerani kuona zinthu zakutali pa diso lililonse palokha. Wodwalayo avale magalasi amene amagwiritsa ntchito poona zinthu zakutali.

acuity-method-pinhole
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Ngati kuona zinthu zakutali kwachepa, bwerezani kuyeza pogwiritsa ntchito kabowo kakang'ono.

acuity-near
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Kenako yezani kuona zinthu zapafupi pogwiritsa ntchito tchati chowerengera.

acuity-reduced
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Kuona zinthu zakutali kwachepa.

acuity-pinhole
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Kabowo kakang'ono sikanathandize kuti wodwalayo aone bwino.

acuity-cataract-near
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Kuona zinthu zapafupi kwachepanso. Zimenezi pamodzi zingasonyeze ng'ala.

acuity-improves
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Ngati wodwalayo akuona bwino kudzera m'kabowo kakang'ono, vuto la mmene diso limayang'anitsira kuwala lingakhale likuchepetsa kuona.

acuity-refraction
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Konzani kuyezetsa magalasi ndipo ganizirani zina zimene mwaona. Ng'ala ndi vuto lolunjika kuwala zingakhalepo nthawi imodzi.

front-examine
00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Gwiritsani ntchito kuwala kwa Arclight kuti muone kutsogolo kwa diso lililonse.

front-compare
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:09.000
Yerekezani maso awiriwo. Yang'anani kufiira, kusawonekera bwino kwa khungu lowonekera lakutsogolo kwa diso, ndi zinthu zina zachilendo.

front-quiet
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:17.000
Kutsogolo kwa diso kungaoneke kwabwinobwino, kopanda kufiira kapena kusintha kooneka bwino pamwamba pake.

front-not-excluded
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Ngakhale kutsogolo kwa diso kukuoneka kwabwinobwino, ng'ala ikhoza kukhalabe kumbuyo kwa mwana wa diso.

front-opacity
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Ngati mwaona malo osaonekera bwino kapena maonekedwe ena achilendo, disolo lifunika kuyezedwanso.

front-red
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Ng'ala yopanda mavuto ena siyambitsa diso lofiira kapena lopweteka. Yezeni disolo ndipo tumizani wodwalayo kumalo oyenera.

pupil-direct
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:52.000
Unikirani kuwala m'diso lililonse mosinthana. Yang'anani mmene mwana wa diso lowunikidwa ndi wa diso linalo akuyankhira.

pupil-swing
00:02:52.000 --> 00:03:01.000
Yerekezani mmene ana a maso akuyankhira pamene mukusuntha kuwala kuchokera m'diso lina kupita m'lina.

pupil-constrict
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:09.000
M'zitsanzo zabwinobwino zimene zikusonyezedwazi, ana a maso amachepa pamene kuwala kwalunjikitsidwa m'maso.

pupil-cataract
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:17.000
Ana a maso a munthu amene ali ndi ng'ala angayankhe kuwala bwinobwino.

pupil-abnormal
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:26.000
Ngati kuyankha kwa mwana wa diso n'kochepa, kulibe kapena n'kosiyana pakati pa maso awiri, wodwalayo afunika kuyezedwanso.

pupil-rapd
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Vuto la uthenga wochokera m'diso kupita ku ubongo lingasonyeze matenda ena kuwonjezera pa ng'ala. Tumizani wodwalayo kuti akayesedwe.

reflex-position
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:44.000
M'chipinda cha kuwala kochepa, yang'anani kudzera mu Arclight muli patali. Yerekezani kuwala kobwerera kuchokera kumbuyo kwa maso awiriwo.

reflex-observe
00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:53.000
Yang'anani mphamvu ndi mtundu wa kuwalako, komanso ngati pali mithunzi mkati mwa mwana wa diso lililonse.

reflex-opacity
00:03:53.000 --> 00:04:04.000
Chitsanzo cha m'gawo lobiriwirachi n'chosiyana ndi zina. Chikusonyeza galasi la diso losaonekera bwino ndi madera amdima ogwirizana ndi ng'ala.

reflex-patterns
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:15.000
Maonekedwe amasiyanasiyana malinga ndi malo ndi kuchuluka kwa kusawonekera kwa galasi la diso. Ganizirani izi pamodzi ndi mbiri ya wodwala ndi kuyezetsa kuona.

reflex-white
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:25.000
Kuwala kobwerera koyera, kotuwa kwambiri, kosapezeka kapena kosiyana pakati pa maso sikuyenera kutchedwa ng'ala nthawi yomweyo.

reflex-referral
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Matenda ena a diso angayambitse kuwala kobwerera kwachilendo. Konzani kuyezetsa disolo. Mwana wa diso woyera mwa mwana amafunika kutumizidwa mwachangu.

fundus-close
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:44.000
Yandikirani kuti muwone kumbuyo kwa diso. Sungani Arclight molunjika ndi mwana wa diso.

fundus-view
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:53.000
Onani mmene mukuwonera kudzera mugalasi la diso. Ngati mukuona bwino, yang'anani retina ndi pomwe mtsempha wa kuona umalowera m'diso.

fundus-hazy
00:04:53.000 --> 00:05:02.000
Galasi la diso likakhala losaonekera bwino, kumbuyo kwa diso kungaoneke ngati kuli chifunga kapena kusaoneka konse.

fundus-limits
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:11.000
Kusawona bwino kumbuyo kwa diso sikutsimikizira kuti retina ili bwino. Ganizirani kutumiza wodwalayo kwa katswiri wa maso.

fundus-abnormal
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:21.000
Zinthu zachilendo zooneka pa retina kapena pomwe mtsempha wa kuona umalowera m'diso zingafotokoze kuchepa kwa kuona ndipo zimafunika kutumiza wodwalayo.

fundus-combine
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:31.000
Phatikizani zotsatira za mbali zonse zisanu ndi chimodzi za kuyezetsa. Ng'ala ingakhalepo pamodzi ndi matenda ena. Gwiritsani ntchito zotsatira zonse posankha kumene mungatumize wodwalayo.
